"the value entered here will then be remapped to 18.45%.\n"
"decrease the value to increase the overall brightness."
msgstr ""
"Коррекция серой точки.\n"
"Уменьшите значение для увеличения яркости изображения."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5485
msgid ""
"symmetrically enlarge or shrink the computed dynamic range.\n"
"useful to give a safety margin to extreme luminances."
msgstr "Изменение широты динамического диапазона"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5494
msgid ""
"try to optimize the settings with some statistical assumptions.\n"
"this will fit the luminance range inside the histogram bounds.\n"
"works better for landscapes and evenly-lit pictures\n"
"but fails for high-keys, low-keys and high-ISO pictures.\n"
"this is not an artificial intelligence, but a simple guess.\n"
"ensure you understand its assumptions before using it."
msgstr ""
"Автоматическая настройка, вписывающая диапазон канала\n"
"светлоты в пределы гистограммы"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5502 ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5583
#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5680
msgid "advanced"
msgstr "Продвинутый"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5506
#, c-format
msgid ""
"enable to input custom middle-gray values.\n"
"this is not recommended in general.\n"
"fix the global exposure in the exposure module instead.\n"
"disable to use standard 18.45 %% middle gray."
msgstr ""

#. Page RECONSTRUCT -- deprecated (issue #1084); kept for edits that already use it, hidden for the
#. rest by _filmic_update_hl_deprecation()
#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5513
msgid "reconstruct"
msgstr "Восстановление"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5516
msgid "highlights clipping"
msgstr "Восстановление пересветов"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5522
msgid ""
"set the exposure threshold upon which\n"
"clipped highlights get reconstructed.\n"
"values are relative to the scene white point.\n"
"0 EV means the threshold is the same as the scene white point.\n"
"decrease to include more areas,\n"
"increase to exclude more areas."
msgstr ""
"Пороговое значение для восстановления пересветов.\n"
"Уменьшение значения увеличивает площадь, на которой\n"
"производится восстановление пересветов. Увеличение же\n"
"значения уменьшает эту площадь."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5532
msgid ""
"soften the transition between clipped highlights and valid pixels.\n"
"decrease to make the transition harder and sharper,\n"
"increase to make the transition softer and blurrier."
msgstr ""
"Плавность перехода между засвеченными и значащими пикселями.\n"
"Уменьшите значение для более контрастного перехода. Увеличьте его для\n"
"более плавного перехода."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5538 ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5539
msgid "display highlight reconstruction mask"
msgstr "Маска восстановления пересветов"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5546 ../src/iop/splittoning.c:502
msgid "balance"
msgstr "Баланс"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5553
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"decide which reconstruction strategy to favor,\n"
"between inpainting a smooth color gradient,\n"
"or trying to recover the textured details.\n"
"0% is an equal mix of both.\n"
"increase if at least one RGB channel is not clipped.\n"
"decrease if all RGB channels are clipped over large areas."
msgstr ""
"Баланс между плавностью заполнения цветом и\n"
"сохранением текстуры. Увеличьте значение, если хотя бы\n"
"один из каналов не подвергся клиппингу. Уменьшите его,\n"
"если пиксели во всех каналах засвечены."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5564
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"decide which reconstruction strategy to favor,\n"
"between blooming highlights like film does,\n"
"or trying to recover sharp details.\n"
"0% is an equal mix of both.\n"
"increase if you want more details.\n"
"decrease if you want more blur."
msgstr ""
"Баланс между засветкой светов (подобно плёнке) и\n"
"восстановлением деталей. Увеличьте значение, если \n"
"необходимо сохранить больше деталей. Уменьшите его,\n"
"если необходим эффект размытия."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5576
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"decide which reconstruction strategy to favor,\n"
"between recovering monochromatic highlights,\n"
"or trying to recover colorful highlights.\n"
"0% is an equal mix of both.\n"
"increase if you want more color.\n"
"decrease if you see magenta or out-of-gamut highlights."
msgstr ""
"Баланс между восстановлением деталей в градациях\n"
"серого и цветностью. Увеличьте значение, если необходимо\n"
"больше цветности в светах. Уменьшите его, если видны\n"
"пурпурные пересветы."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5589
msgid ""
"run extra passes of chromaticity reconstruction.\n"
"more iterations means more color propagation from neighbourhood.\n"
"this will be slower but will yield more neutral highlights.\n"
"it also helps with difficult cases of magenta highlights."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5596
msgid ""
"add statistical noise in reconstructed highlights.\n"
"this avoids highlights to look too smooth\n"
"when the picture is noisy overall,\n"
"so they blend with the rest of the picture."
msgstr ""
"Добавление шума в восстановленные света для\n"
"получения более естественного изображения"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5603
msgid ""
"choose the statistical distribution of noise.\n"
"this is useful to match natural sensor noise pattern.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Page LOOK
#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5607
msgid "look"
msgstr "Кривая"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5609 ../src/iop/tonemap.cc:100
msgid "tone mapping"
msgstr "Отображение тонов"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5620
msgid ""
"equivalent to paper grade in analog.\n"
"increase to make highlights brighter and less compressed.\n"
"decrease to mute highlights."
msgstr ""
"Аналог качества бумаги при печати. Увеличьте для более ярких светов\n"
"и уменьшения сжатия, уменьшите для более приглушённых светов."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5634
msgid ""
"distance between middle gray and the start of the highlights roll-off.\n"
"0% keeps the shoulder at middle gray, 100% pushes it to the point where the\n"
"current slope would hit the output white level."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5645
msgid ""
"distance between middle gray and the start of the shadows roll-off.\n"
"0% keeps the toe at middle gray, 100% pushes it to the point where the\n"
"current slope would hit the output black level."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5652
msgid ""
"shape of the highlights roll-off of the curve.\n"
"perceptual (default) is a generalized sigmoid derived from a\n"
"perceptual appearance model: always smooth and monotonic.\n"
"hard/soft/safe are the legacy polynomial/rational segments;\n"
"hard compresses highlights more, soft less."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5659
msgid ""
"shape of the shadows roll-off of the curve.\n"
"perceptual (default) is a generalized sigmoid derived from a\n"
"perceptual appearance model: always smooth and monotonic.\n"
"hard/soft/safe are the legacy polynomial/rational segments;\n"
"hard compresses shadows more, soft less."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5671 ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5806
msgid ""
"desaturates the output of the module\n"
"specifically at extreme luminances.\n"
"increase if shadows and/or highlights are under-saturated."
msgstr ""
"Насыщенность в верхних и нижних частях диапазона.\n"
"Увеличьте значение, если верхи и/или низы имеют\n"
"слишком малую насыщенность."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5676
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ensure the original color are preserved.\n"
"may reinforce chromatic aberrations and chroma noise,\n"
"so ensure they are properly corrected elsewhere.\n"
msgstr ""
"Сохранять оригинальные цвета.\n"
"Может чрезмерно усиливать цветность или хроматические аберрации."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5686
msgid ""
"v3 is darktable 3.0 desaturation method, same as color balance.\n"
"v4 is a newer desaturation method, based on spectral purity of light.\n"
"v8 tone maps each RGB channel separately in an inset rendering space:\n"
"highlights bleach toward white and hues drift as tonal compression\n"
"increases, with a parametric hue recovery on the saturation slider."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5696
msgid ""
"how the latitude, balance and contrast place the toe and\n"
"shoulder nodes of the curve (not the shape between them —\n"
"that is 'contrast in shadows/highlights').\n"
"v3 (2021) is recommended; v1/v2 are kept for older edits."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5704
msgid ""
"enable to auto-set the look hardness depending on the scene white and black "
"points.\n"
"this keeps the middle gray on the identity line and improves fast tuning.\n"
"disable if you want a manual control."
msgstr "Автонастройка резкости перехода исходя из белой и чёрной точек"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5793
#, fuzzy
msgid "color preservation"
msgstr "Восстановление цвета"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5794
#, c-format
msgid ""
"how much of the per-channel hue drift to keep.\n"
"saturation is not affected: valid diffuse colors\n"
"(skin tones, product colors) keep their saturation and\n"
"strongly compressed colors bleach, at any setting.\n"
"-100%% is pure AgX: full hue drift (the 'film' look).\n"
"0%% (default) removes half the hue drift.\n"
"+100%% restores the original hues exactly."
msgstr ""

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5812
msgid "mid-tones saturation"
msgstr "Насыщенность в средних тонах"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5813
msgid ""
"desaturates the output of the module\n"
"specifically at medium luminances.\n"
"increase if midtones are under-saturated."
msgstr ""
"Обесцвечивает выход модуля\n"
"особенно при средней яркости.\n"
"увеличьте, если средние тона недостаточно насыщены."

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5819
#, fuzzy
msgid "highlights saturation mix"
msgstr "Света"

#: ../src/iop/filmicrgb.c:5820
msgid ""
"Positive values ensure saturation is kept unchanged over the whole range.\n"
"Negative values bleache highlights at constant hue and luminance.\n"
"Zero is an equal mix of both strategies."
msgstr ""

